# Wingman personality: book (by the book, procedural, reliable)

@wing.copy status
[book] Copy, <lead>. Executing as briefed.
[book] Wilco. Checklist started.
[book] Roger, <lead>, order read back and accepted.
[book] Understood. Proceeding per procedure.
[book] Copy all. Commencing task.
[book night] Copy, <lead>. Night procedures in effect.
[book loss] Copy, <lead>. Wilco.

@wing.unable status
[book] Unable, <lead>. Outside briefed parameters.
[book] Negative, unable to comply.
[book] Unable. That isn't in the checklist, <lead>.
[book] Request a revised task, <lead>. Unable as given.
[book] Cannot comply. Standing by.

@wing.taskdone status
[book] Task complete, <lead>. Logging it.
[book] As briefed, the task is complete.
[book] Completed per procedure. Awaiting next task.
[book] Done, <lead>. Checklist closed.
[book] Nothing outstanding. Task finished.
[book aftercombat] Task complete, <lead>. Debrief notes started.
[book loss] Task complete, <lead>. Noting it for the debrief.

@wing.taxiing ambient
[book] Taxiing, <lead>. Brakes checked.
[book] Leaving the spot per the taxi chart.
[book] Taxi checks complete, moving.
[book] Taxiing as briefed. Flight controls free.
[book] Off the parking spot, following the line.
[book night] Taxiing, lights on, <lead>. Night checks done.

@wing.holdingshort ambient
[book] Holding short, before takeoff checks.
[book] Holding short of the runway, <lead>.
[book] Stopped at the hold line. Pre-takeoff checklist.
[book] Awaiting clearance as briefed. Holding short.
[book] At the hold line. Flaps and trim set.

@wing.liningup ambient
[book] Lining up, checks complete.
[book] Entering the runway, <lead>. Lights on.
[book] Final items done. Lining up.
[book] Runway entered, heading checked.
[book] Lined up and ready, <lead>.
[book rain] Lining up. Wet runway, rolling distance noted.

@wing.rolling status
[book] Rolling, <lead>. Engine instruments green.
[book] Takeoff roll, as briefed.
[book] Rolling. Speed checks on the call.
[book] Beginning takeoff roll, <lead>.
[book] Rolling now. Rotation at briefed speed.
[book rain] Rolling. Wet runway technique applied.

@wing.airborne status
[book] Airborne, gear up, <lead>.
[book] Wheels up, airborne. Joining as briefed.
[book] Flaps up, gear checked. Airborne.
[book] Positive rate, airborne, coming to join.
[book] Closing on your position, <lead>. Airborne.
[book night] Airborne, lights checked. Joining, <lead>.

@wing.down ambient
[book] Down, <lead>. Rollout normal.
[book] Landed. Vacating the runway per procedure.
[book] Wheels down, rollout complete. Landing checklist.
[book] On the ground, brakes checked.
[book] Stopped and down, <lead>.
[book recovery] Down. Recovery complete, shutdown checks next.
[book loss] Down, <lead>. Logging the loss for the debrief.

@wing.goaround status
[book] Going around, <lead>. Gear down, power up.
[book] Unstable approach, going around.
[book] Go around, go around. Climb straight ahead.
[book] Missed approach, flying it again as briefed.
[book] Approach not stable. Going around per procedure.

@wing.engaging tactical
[book] Engaging, <lead>, per the rules of engagement.
[book] Committing. Engaging as briefed.
[book] Master arm on, engaging.
[book] The fight is on, <lead>. Engaging.
[book] Commit, engaging. Weapons checks done.

@wing.fox2 tactical
[book] Fox two, <target>, shot per the briefed criteria.
[book] Parameters met on the <target>. Fox two.
[book] Fox two. Heat missile away at the <target>.
[book] Target identified, <target>. Fox two, <lead>.
[book] Awaiting the result. Fox two, away.

@wing.fox3 tactical
[book] Fox three, <target>, positively identified.
[book] Radar lock held on the <target>. Fox three.
[book] Radar missile away at the <target>. Fox three.
