[book] Magnum, away.

@wing.rifle tactical
[book] Rifle, <target>, identified and cleared.
[book] Missile away at the <target>. Rifle.
[book] Air-to-ground missile away at the <target>. Rifle.
[book] Per the briefed target list, <lead>. Rifle.
[book] Rifle, away.

@wing.splash tactical
[book] Splash one <target>, <lead>. Confirmed.
[book] Splash, <target>. Kill confirmed on tape.
[book] <target> destroyed. Splash one.
[book] Reporting the kill as briefed. Splash.
[book] Splash, <lead>. Target destroyed.
[book loss] Splash, <target>. Kill logged, <lead>.

@wing.bandit tactical
[book] Bandit, <bra>, hostile as per ID.
[book] Bandit! <bra>, <lead>.
[book] Declared hostile. Bandit, <bra>.
[book] New bandit, <bra>, <type>.
[book] Calling it for the log. Bandit <bra>.

@wing.contact status
[book] Contact, <bra>. Ground target identified.
[book] Ground contact, <bra>, <lead>.
[book] New contact at <bra>, <type>. Reporting position.
[book] Contact on the ground, <bra>. Awaiting tasking.
[book] Logging a contact, <bra>. Report follows.

@wing.bogeydope tactical
[book] Nearest bandit, <bra>, <lead>.
[book] Bandit, <bra>. Closest hostile.
[book] Bandit <bra>, <type>. Nearest threat.
[book] Picture: single bandit, <bra>.
[book] Closest threat, <bra>. As requested.

@wing.clean tactical
[book] Clean, <lead>. No threats on the scope.
[book] Picture clean. Scope is clear.
[book] Naked, <lead>. No bandits.
[book] Nothing within range. Clean.
[book] Scope clear, as requested.
[book aftercombat] Clean, <lead>. Recommend staying alert anyway.

@wing.panic emergency
[book] Missile! Defending!
[book] Defending, missile inbound!
[book] Break! Missile!
[book] Missile, missile, defending!

@wing.defensiveclear tactical
[book] Missile defeated, <lead>. Resuming.
[book] Defensive complete. Missile defeated.
[book] Clean, missile is gone. Back on task.
[book] The missile is gone. Checking systems.
[book] Defeated it. Defensive done, <lead>.

@wing.pullup emergency
[book] Pull up! Ground proximity.
[book] Terrain! Pulling up!
[book] Pull up, pull up!
[book] Ground avoidance engaged!

@wing.breakoff emergency
[book] Break off, break off!
[book] Collision, breaking!
[book] Traffic, breaking off, <lead>!
[book] Too close, break!

@wing.maneuvering tactical
[book] Executing <detail>, as briefed.
[book] <detail> started, <lead>.
[book] Commencing <detail>, wilco.
[book] Flying <detail> per the order.
[book] Starting <detail> now.

@wing.maneuverdone status
[book] Maneuver complete, <lead>.
[book] Returning to formation. Maneuver done.
[book] Completed. Back to briefed position.
[book] Reaction maneuver flown out, wilco.
[book] Checks normal. Maneuver finished.

@wing.fallingback tactical
[book] Falling back, <lead>. Outnumbered.
[book] Disengaging, outnumbered, per the plan.
[book] Pulling out. Odds are outside limits.
[book] Falling back to the rejoin point.
[book] Outnumbered. I am disengaging.

@wing.rejoining status
[book] Rejoining, <lead>. Formation per the brief.
[book] Coming back to formation.
[book] Disengaged, rejoining on you.
[book] Rejoin in progress, <lead>.
[book] Returning to position as briefed.
