@wing.outofammo status
[book] Weapons expended, <lead>. Remaining with the wing.
[book] No ordnance remaining. Staying in formation.
[book] Empty, remaining with the flight.
[book] Out of ammo. Will support as briefed.
[book] Racks empty, staying on you, <lead>.

@wing.joker status
[book] Joker, <n> minutes to bingo.
[book] <n> minutes to bingo, <lead>. Joker fuel.
[book] Joker fuel state, <n> minutes to bingo.
[book] Fuel check. Bingo in <n> minutes.
[book] Reached joker, <lead>. Bingo in <n>.

@wing.bingo status
[book] Bingo fuel, <lead>.
[book] Bingo. Returning to base.
[book] Bingo, per the fuel plan. Heading home.
