@wing.fallingbehind status
[book] Falling behind, <lead>. Request speed reduction.
[book] Unable to maintain pace. Falling behind.
[book] I can't hold formation speed, <lead>.
[book] Please reduce speed. Falling behind.
[book] Speed exceeds my limits. Falling behind.

@wing.damaged status
[book] Damage taken, <lead>. Running checks.
[book] I'm hit. Performing the damage checklist.
[book] Damaged. Systems under review.
[book] Hit, <lead>. Reporting damage.
[book] Taking damage, assessing.
[book rain] Hit, in rain. Adjusting the checklist.

@wing.airframelost tactical
[book] <n> is down, <lead>.
[book] Airframe lost, number <n>.
[book] We have lost <n>. Closing the formation.
[book] Number <n> is down. Noting position.
[book] Heads up, <lead>. <n> is down.

@wing.ejected tactical
[book] <n> has ejected, <lead>. Marking position.
[book] Ejection, number <n>. Chute observed.
[book] <n> is out. Noting the location.
[book] Eject, eject, <n>. Reporting.
[book] Number <n> ejected. Searching for a chute.

